        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Samthai ethei tingkau thu 4@&,",
            "Muang le banchuanga ru khou;",
            "Samthai ethei tingkau ram khou,",
            "Salem ram khou sam tang ni.",
            "Kaluang guai kachak dui ruina",
            "Luang lik lou kabam thui khou,",
            "Nang ringmei riu rui gan likge,",
            "Nang rui jianpui ram gai khou.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Ai rui ninge tingsang namdai,",
            "Bumang thanmei nun bam 4@&;",
            "Katik gun rui mundui kumma,",
            "Ringmei dui 4@& luang bam e.",
            "",
            "2. Hei khou hei bammei nun guai rui,",
            "Theimei kandih lou duna;",
            "Kaniu Raguang ram gaimei khou,",
            "Kaniu mikdui kei lak khe.",
            "Gun kumma phuan lou ngam puni,",
            "Kandih lun phung dat lak khe;",
            "Rianramei guai khang dat lak khe,",
            "Jisu le bam cham pukhou.",
            "",
            "3. Tingsangjang njianmei nun le,",
            "Hei ramgai khou lung cham ni;",
            "Kandih khou bampui gan kumma,",
            "Achun hei gei dat lak khe.",
            "Kandih khou rianrana bammei,",
            "Chungsi jangsi kapumma;",
            "Tingkau namdai guangtang pukhou,",
            "Nai lak khe kapumma 4@&."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
